<main id="chapters"><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-qahwa.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-qahwa.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Khamrah Qahwa – Alba · tenda beduina" width="1800" height="1195"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Alba · tenda beduina</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="قهوة"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="150" style="">قهوة</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Qahwa</div><p class="mean fade">Il caffè. Nella tenda lo si versa dalla dallah prima che il sole sorga sulle dune.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Khamrah Qahwa</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-khamrah-qahwa-eau-de'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-khamrah-qahwa-eau-de">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-yara.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-yara.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Yara Tous – Mattino · la camera di una ragazza" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Mattino · la camera di una ragazza</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="يارا"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="150">يارا</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Yara</div><p class="mean fade">Un nome arabo di ragazza. Non rivela altro – il resto lo racconta la luce attraverso la mashrabiya.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Yara Tous</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-yara-tous-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-yara-tous-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-abiyedh.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-abiyedh.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Ana Abiyedh Scarlet – Mezzogiorno · lago salato" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Mezzogiorno · lago salato</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="أنا الأبيض"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="96">أنا الأبيض</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Ana al-Abyaḍ</div><p class="mean fade">«Io sono il bianco.» Un nome che dice bianco – e un flacone scarlatto.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Ana Abiyedh Scarlet</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-ana-abiyedh-scarlet'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-ana-abiyedh-scarlet">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-areeq.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-areeq.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Pride Al Areeq Gold – Pomeriggio · un liwan a Damasco" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Pomeriggio · un liwan a Damasco</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="العريق"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="120">العريق</text></svg><div class="trans fade">al-ʿArīq</div><p class="mean fade">L'antico, il profondamente radicato. Come una casa di Damasco che porta la sua storia nel legno e nella pietra.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Pride Al Areeq Gold</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-pride-al-areeq-gold-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-pride-al-areeq-gold-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-stone.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-stone.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Niche Emarati Classic Stone – Tardo pomeriggio · Al Fahidi, Dubai" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Tardo pomeriggio · Al Fahidi, Dubai</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="حجر"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="150">حجر</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Ḥajar</div><p class="mean fade">Pietra. Le antiche case del quartiere Al Fahidi furono costruite in pietra corallina – sopra, le torri del vento.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Niche Emarati Classic Stone</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-niche-emirati-classic-stone-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-niche-emirati-classic-stone-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-khamrah.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-khamrah.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Khamrah – Sera · majlis" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Sera · majlis</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="خمرة"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="150">خمرة</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Khamra</div><p class="mean fade">L'inebriante. Una parola per tutto ciò che scalda i sensi e li rende pesanti.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Khamrah</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-khamrah-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-khamrah-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-petra.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-petra.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Petra – Notte · Petra, Giordania" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Notte · Petra, Giordania</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="البتراء"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="96">البتراء</text></svg><div class="trans fade">al-Batrāʾ</div><p class="mean fade">Petra – la città di roccia nel sud della Giordania, scolpita nell'arenaria rosa. Di notte, davanti al Tesoro ardono le candele.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Petra</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-petra-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-petra-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-hayaam.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-hayaam.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Niche Hayaam – Mezzanotte · dune al chiaro di luna" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Mezzanotte · dune al chiaro di luna</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="هيام"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="150">هيام</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Hayām</div><p class="mean fade">Un amore così grande da perdersi in esso – come un viandante nel deserto.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Niche Hayaam</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-niche-hayaam-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-niche-hayaam-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section></main>
