ection class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-abiyedh.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-abiyedh.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Ana Abiyedh Scarlet – Mittag · Salzsee" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Mittag · Salzsee</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="أنا الأبيض"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="96">أنا الأبيض</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Ana al-Abyaḍ</div><p class="mean fade">„Ich bin das Weiße.“ Ein Name, der Weiß sagt – und eine Flasche in Scharlachrot.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Ana Abiyedh Scarlet</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-ana-abiyedh-scarlet'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-ana-abiyedh-scarlet">Zum Duft</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-areeq.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-areeq.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Pride Al Areeq Gold – Nachmittag · Liwan in Damaskus" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Nachmittag · Liwan in Damaskus</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="العريق"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="120">العريق</text></svg><div class="trans fade">al-ʿArīq</div><p class="mean fade">Das Altehrwürdige, tief Verwurzelte. Wie ein Damaszener Haus, das seine Geschichte in Holz und Stein trägt.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Pride Al Areeq Gold</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-pride-al-areeq-gold-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-pride-al-areeq-gold-eau-de-parfum">Zum Duft</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-stone.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-stone.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Niche Emarati Classic Stone – Später Nachmittag · Al Fahidi, Dubai" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Später Nachmittag · Al Fahidi, Dubai</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="حجر"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="150">حجر</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Ḥajar</div><p class="mean fade">Stein. Die alten Häuser im Al-Fahidi-Viertel wurden aus Korallenstein gebaut – darüber die Windtürme.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Niche Emarati Classic Stone</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-niche-emirati-classic-stone-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-niche-emirati-classic-stone-eau-de-parfum">Zum Duft</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-khamrah.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-khamrah.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Khamrah – Abend · Majlis" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Abend · Majlis</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="خمرة"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="150">خمرة</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Khamra</div><p class="mean fade">Das Berauschende. Ein Wort für alles, was die Sinne wärmt und schwer werden lässt.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Khamrah</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-khamrah-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-khamrah-eau-de-parfum">Zum Duft</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-petra.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-petra.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Petra – Nacht · Petra, Jordanien" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Nacht · Petra, Jordanien</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="البتراء"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="96">البتراء</text></svg><div class="trans fade">al-Batrāʾ</div><p class="mean fade">Petra – die Felsenstadt im Süden Jordaniens, in rosaroten Sandstein gehauen. Nachts brennen vor dem Schatzhaus die Kerzen.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Petra</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-petra-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ lt_shop }}lattafa-petra-eau-de-parfum">Zum Duft</a></div></div></section><section class="ch"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['lt-s-hayaam.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['lt-s-hayaam.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="Lattafa Niche Hayaam – Mitternacht · Dünen im Mondlicht" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="time">Mitternacht · Dünen im Mondlicht</div><svg class="word" viewBox="0 0 430 250" role="img" aria-label="هيام"><text class="ink" x="6" y="185" text-anchor="end" direction="rtl" font-size="150">هيام</text></svg><div class="trans fade">Hayām</div><p class="mean fade">Eine Liebe, die so groß ist, dass man sich in ihr verliert – wie ein Wanderer in der Wüste.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>Lattafa Niche Hayaam</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['lattafa-niche-hayaam-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ 